  description "Owner selects Luna none subconscious and Grok conscious/adjudication/narration. Prepare existing transport and regression tests; full pipeline role dispatch stays unactivated until architecture acceptance."
  duration 1p
  status done
  requires:
    DEV 1
  source "docs/battle-consciousness-model-compatibility-2026-10-05.md"

